# Keep ScienceDirect article sessions and PDF authorization on the same direct IP.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,sciencedirect.com
# ScienceDirect recommends bypassing proxies for its PDF delivery host.
DOMAIN,pdf.sciencedirectassets.com

